人可以選擇肉多的版本，可以一次吃到豬叉燒和雞叉燒兩種；麵體的話可以選粗的拉麵或細的拉麵，也可以選麵的軟硬。\n湯頭的話，比較偏重鹹口味，無論金沙湯頭或雞白湯喝起來都滿鹹的，但自助吧台區有提供兩壺高湯，可以加湯調整湯的口味，加了高湯後，味道才比較沒那麼鹹。\n整體來說算是中規中矩的拉麵店。",null,[0,158]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16235809232869911519/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUTNlV1pNZUZWQkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,8051,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3eWZMeFVBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x6bd47f28faf27026!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID7yfLxUA%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3eWZMeFVBEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3eWZMeFVBEi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRDd5Zkx4MEFFEhJDZ3NJbTZ5dHRnWVFvTl9ES0EaLAoWQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lEN3lmTHhNQRISQ2dzSW02eXR0Z1lRb05fREtBIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARJnDy-ih_1GsqCzBhbXBOUTQzRHlW\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj54cj4v9KWAxWmma8BHa4hEDIQoykIlQIoFA"],null,[null,[[1,1]]]],"0ahUKEwjSnND4v9KWAxWfdF4EHU1zGF0Q0pMFCJcBKAc"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj54cj4v9KWAxWmma8BHa4hEDIQ0pMFCPABKAc"]],null,null,null,"other_user_google_review_posts__and__hotel_and_vr_partner_review_posts",null,"CjEIARIpCgoAP7_LAQjE____EhBjxiOVnVnA17KvxtwAAAAAGgn92RcCbnW3pjMYAC